+  // POST /projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}/move {"toProjectId": dest}
+  // The source side follows the update rules (contributors only move tasks
+  // assigned to themselves). The destination must be readable, writable by the
+  // caller and not archived. The task keeps its assignee, so the assignee must
